# Generated frame-runtime artifacts are BYTE-CHECKED by
# apps/web/src/lib/experience-frame-runtime.test.ts (the generator runs in
# --check mode and byte-compares its in-memory build against the file on
# disk). With core.autocrlf=true a checkout/stash smudges these files to
# CRLF while the generator writes LF — the freshness gate then fails on
# every git operation until a manual regen. Pin LF for the generated dir
# so the working-tree bytes always equal the generator's output.
# Scoped to this directory on purpose — repo-wide EOL policy is not ours.
apps/web/src/generated/** text eol=lf
